## Core concepts

### Services

Business logic belongs in services. UI components must not contain system calls or configuration logic.

### Theme system

All visual values must come from the active theme via tokens and a ThemeService.

### Configuration

Configuration is centralized under `~/.config/daemon-core/` and resolved in a strict priority order.

### Safety

If configuration, theme, or service data is invalid, the system must fall back to defaults or safe mode instead of crashing.

## Default configuration resolution

```text
Runtime state
    ↓
User config
    ↓
Profile config
    ↓
Default config
    ↓
Safe fallback
```

